    },
    {
      "id": "guyu-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "谷雨是二十四节气中的第六个：太阳到达黄经30°，春季最后一个节气。",
        "en": "Guyu is the sixth and final spring term: the Sun reaches 30°."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2022年机构稿仍在沿用同一表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-guyu-feature",
        "source-xinhua-guyu-2022"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-guyu-longitude-30"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "guyu-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "谷雨是农历三月的\"中气\"。宋《岁时广记》引三统历：「穀雨者言雨以生百穀」。",
        "en": "Guyu is the zhongqi of the third lunar month. Its name means \"rain that brings forth grain.\""
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（传统历法编算规则）"
      ],
      "period": "现行农历编算口径；GB/T 33661-2017 为现行国家标准（正文条款待人工核读）",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-yueling-qishierhou-wikisource"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-jieqi-zhongqi"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "guyu-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "谷雨时节降雨增多，是春播关键窗口。",
        "en": "Increased rainfall makes Guyu a critical sowing window."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（机构表述口径；\"降雨增多\"为节气气候经验概括，非分区气候统计）"
      ],
      "period": "当代机构/媒体科普口径（2017非遗网稿、2022新华社稿）",
      "source_ids": [
